<title>NETHERLANDS: SPEED SKATING-DUTCHWOMAN DE JONG IS EUROPEAN CHAMPION.</title>
<headline>SPEED SKATING-DUTCHWOMAN DE JONG IS EUROPEAN CHAMPION.</headline>
<dateline>HEERENVEEN, Netherlands 1997-01-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutchwoman Tonny de Jong won the women's European speed skating championship on Sunday with a points total of 169,375, a national record.</p>
<p>Germany's Gunda Niemann came second and Barabara de Loor of the Netherlands was third.</p>
</text>
